<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>{{ email_title }}</title><style>
@media only screen and (max-width:520px){.wrap{width:100%!important;border-radius:0!important}.col{display:block!important;width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box}.h1{font-size:26px!important;line-height:31px!important}}
</style></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FBF7F4">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0">Tu pedido {{ order_name }} ya salió. Aquí está tu seguimiento.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FBF7F4"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 10px">
<table role="presentation" class="wrap" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden">
<tr><td style="background:#1E1B24;padding:10px 20px;text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#f3e6ea">Envío a todo Chile &nbsp;·&nbsp; Pagas al recibir o con tarjeta</td></tr>
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:26px 24px 4px"><a href="{{ shop.url }}">{%- if shop.email_logo_url -%}<img src="{{ shop.email_logo_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="{{ shop.email_logo_width | default: 180 }}" style="display:block;width:{{ shop.email_logo_width | default: 180 }}px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0">{%- else -%}<span style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#1E1B24;letter-spacing:-1px">ecoms <span style="color:#B5536A">beauty</span></span>{%- endif -%}</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 32px 6px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#B5536A">Pedido {{ order_name }} despachado</td></tr><tr><td class="h1" style="padding:0 32px 10px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:35px;font-weight:800;color:#1E1B24;letter-spacing:-.5px">¡Tu pedido va en camino{% if customer.first_name %}, {{ customer.first_name }}{% endif %}!</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 32px 18px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4a3f45">Ya despachamos tu pedido. Debería llegar en <b>3 a 6 días hábiles</b>. Si pediste pago contra entrega, ten el monto listo para quien lo reciba.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 26px 14px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="33%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding:6px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FFF1F4;border-radius:16px"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:14px 8px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#6A5C62;padding-top:2px">Preparación</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:#6A5C62;padding-top:2px">Listo</div></td></tr></table></td><td width="33%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding:6px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#1E1B24;border-radius:16px"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:14px 8px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;padding-top:2px">Despacho</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:#f3e6ea;padding-top:2px">En camino</div></td></tr></table></td><td width="33%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding:6px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FFF1F4;border-radius:16px"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:14px 8px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#6A5C62;padding-top:2px">Entrega</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:#6A5C62;padding-top:2px">3 a 6 días hábiles</div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>{%- if fulfillment.tracking_numbers.size > 0 -%}<tr><td style="padding:0 32px 18px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FFF1F4;border-radius:16px"><tr><td style="padding:16px 18px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4a3f45"><div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#6A5C62;padding-bottom:6px">Seguimiento</div>{%- if fulfillment.tracking_company -%}{{ fulfillment.tracking_company }}<br>{%- endif -%}N° {{ fulfillment.tracking_numbers.first }}</td></tr></table></td></tr>{%- endif -%}{%- if fulfillment.tracking_url -%}<tr><td align="center" style="padding:8px 32px 26px"><a href="{{ fulfillment.tracking_url }}" style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:#1E1B24;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:999px">Seguir mi pedido&nbsp;&rarr;</a></td></tr>{%- else -%}<tr><td align="center" style="padding:8px 32px 26px"><a href="{{ order_status_url }}" style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:#1E1B24;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:999px">Ver estado de mi pedido&nbsp;&rarr;</a></td></tr>{%- endif -%}<tr><td style="padding:10px 32px 8px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#6A5C62">Tu pedido</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 32px 6px">
{%- for line in fulfillment.fulfillment_line_items -%}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E7DAD6"><tr>
<td width="76" valign="middle" style="padding:12px 0">{%- if line.line_item.image -%}<img src="{{ line.line_item | img_url: 'compact_cropped' }}" width="64" height="64" alt="" style="display:block;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #E7DAD6;object-fit:cover">{%- endif -%}</td>
<td valign="middle" style="padding:12px 10px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1E1B24">{{ line.line_item.title }}</div>

<div style="font-size:13px;color:#6A5C62;padding-top:2px">Cantidad: {{ line.quantity }}</div>

</td>
<td align="right" valign="middle" style="padding:12px 0;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">

</td>
</tr></table>
{%- endfor -%}
</td></tr>{%- if shipping_address -%}<tr><td style="padding:0 32px 22px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FFF1F4;border-radius:16px"><tr>
<td class="col" width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 18px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4a3f45"><div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#6A5C62;padding-bottom:6px">Dirección de envío</div>{{ shipping_address.name }}<br>{{ shipping_address.address1 }}{% if shipping_address.address2 != blank %}, {{ shipping_address.address2 }}{% endif %}<br>{{ shipping_address.city }}, {{ shipping_address.province }}</td>
<td class="col" width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 18px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4a3f45"><div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#6A5C62;padding-bottom:6px">Pago</div>{% if order.financial_status == 'paid' %}Pagado{% else %}Pagas al recibir{% endif %}<br>Pedido {{ order_name }}</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>{%- endif -%}
<tr><td style="background:#1E1B24;padding:24px 28px;text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><div style="font-size:14px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;padding-bottom:8px">¿Dudas? Responde este correo y te ayudamos.</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#f3e6ea;padding-bottom:12px">10 días de retracto &nbsp;·&nbsp; 6 meses de garantía legal</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;padding-bottom:12px"><a href="{{ shop.url }}/policies/shipping-policy" style="color:#F5B5C5;text-decoration:none">Envíos</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="{{ shop.url }}/policies/refund-policy" style="color:#F5B5C5;text-decoration:none">Cambios y devoluciones</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color:#F5B5C5;text-decoration:none">{{ shop.domain | default: shop.url }}</a></div>
<div style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#b9a6ac">{{ shop.name }} · Santiago, Chile</div></td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>
